    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The fan spins round and round and round... and round... and round...

...and it's making you real dizzy.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a2" name="=&gt;a2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::It seems like this fan is large enough for you to pass through; the large spinning blades are an obstacle you don't want to underestimate, though. You could try leaping through, but the confined space you're in requires some well-controlled and well-executed movement if you want to progress safely.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a4" name="=&gt;a4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Agility] Try to jump between the fan blades.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Elegantly and without much effort you dive through the spinning blades and reach the other side.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You leap through head first, but because you were too slow and your timing was off, your attempt ends with one of the blades smacking you right in the head. The fan roars for a moment but soon returns to its regular whooshing, bearing no scars other than a slightly bent blade. Your head is pulsating with pain, ::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::but you'll survive.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::and your vision becomes blurry...::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
